    "created_at": "2016-03-21T09:08:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-21T09:08:37Z",
    "body": "Yeah, I think it should probably keep the same interface. I guess we should then work on allowing concepts of the HTML script element to be reused in some easy manner and figure out what the implications of the SVG features are on the script processing model. E.g., what does it meant to animate the URL?\n",
